    .string "[MEMORY] Celadon Hideout (Echo)\n"
    .string "stabilized. Dock crews report local hires\n"
    .string "were pushed out for ROCKET freight quotas.$"

@ NARRATIVE_REVIEW:WAR_SENSITIVE
RocketHideout_B4F_Text_RedImpactBeat_C1::
    .string "[RED-IMPACT:C1] Local dispatch calls RED a\n"
    .string "minor disruption, but the route gate is\n"
    .string "sealed and half the checkpoint staff is gone.$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_MemoryChapterIntro::
    .string "[MEMORY:C1] Celadon operations begin.\n"
    .string "Secure the hideout, keep pressure on\n"
    .string "civilians low, and reach GIOVANNI.$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_MemoryChapterOutro::
    .string "[MEMORY:C1] Hideout objective complete.\n"
    .string "Silph route is now the active chapter\n"
    .string "path. Prepare for transfer.$"
RocketHideout_B4F_Text_RocketOps_MilestoneLogged_C1::
    .string "[ROCKETOPS:C1] Milestone logged. Celadon\n"
    .string "chain archived for chapter transfer.$"

@ NARRATIVE_REVIEW:WAR_SENSITIVE
RocketHideout_B4F_Text_ChapterReveal_InfrastructureControl::
    .string "[REVEAL:C1] Infrastructure control wasn't\n"
    .string "muscle. It was routing: power, freight,\n"
    .string "and exits through one command spine.$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_RocketReport_ObjectivesIncomplete::
    .string "[REPORT:C1] RocketOps milestone missing.\n"
    .string "Complete chapter commands before leaving\n"
    .string "for the next fragment.$"


