    .string "[MEMORY] Unrelated exits are sealed in\n"
    .string "this chapter fragment.$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_MemoryChapterMismatch::
    .string "[MEMORY] The chapter state is unstable.\n"
    .string "Please continue from the current fragment.$"


RocketHideout_B4F_Text_MemoryMedicTerminalIntro::
    .string "[MEMORY] ROCKET medic terminal online.\n"
    .string "Emergency stabilization in progress.$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_MemoryMedicTerminalDone::
    .string "[MEMORY] Team restored. This terminal is\n"
    .string "the chapter-safe fallback point.$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_MemoryMedicTerminalMismatch::
    .string "[MEMORY] This terminal only stabilizes\n"
    .string "chapter 1 operations.$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_MemoryMedicTerminalOffline::
    .string "The terminal is dead. It only responds\n"
    .string "inside GIOVANNI's memory fragment.$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_RocketOps_SecureRoute_C1::
    .string "[ROCKETOPS:C1] Secure route confirmed\n"
    .string "One hallway loop has been stabilized.$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_RocketOps_DeployAgent_C1::
    .string "[ROCKETOPS:C1] Field guard unit deployed\n"
    .string "to Route 2 perimeter support.$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_RocketOps_DestroyData_C1::
    .string "[ROCKETOPS:C1] Backup trainer roster\n"
    .string "deleted from local records.$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_RocketOps_ExtractStaff_C1::
    .string "[ROCKETOPS:C1] Logistics gate cycled open.\n"
    .string "Supply lock now routes checkpoint aid.$"


RocketHideout_B4F_Text_RocketOps_StatusReport_SecureCorridor_C1::
    .string "[REPORT:C1] Corridor lock acknowledged.\n"
    .string "Blast shutters around the Giovanni hall\n"
    .string "have been disengaged.$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_RocketOps_StatusReport_HoldPosition_C1::
    .string "[REPORT:C1] Hold position confirmed.\n"
    .string "Basement patrols are freezing in place\n"
    .string "to avoid crossfire near civilians.$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_RocketOps_StatusReport_OpenRoute_C1::
    .string "[REPORT:C1] Open route relayed.\n"
    .string "Service lane to the medic corridor is\n"
    .string "now marked as safe passage.$"

@ NARRATIVE_REVIEW:WAR_SENSITIVE
RocketHideout_B4F_Text_GruntReport_ObjectiveLive::
    .string "[REPORT:C1] Storefront pressure is still\n"
    .string "high. Keep civilians moving away from\n"
    .string "the freight lanes.$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_GruntReport_ObjectiveDone::
    .string "[REPORT:C1] Celadon segment closed.\n"
    .string "Silph command took over the chapter\n"
    .string "route as ordered.$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_RecurringOpsOfficer_Act1::
    .string "[OPS OFFICER VERA:C1-A1] Keep those route\n"
    .string "updates tight. We are moving civilians\n"
    .string "before the floor turns hot.$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_RecurringOpsOfficer_Act2::
    .string "[OPS OFFICER VERA:C1-A2] Corridor is open.\n"
    .string "Confidence is easy before the first\n"
    .string "mistake, so don't give me one.$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_RecurringOpsOfficer_Act3::
    .string "[OPS OFFICER VERA:C1-A3] Chapter closes clean.\n"
    .string "I said we could run this operation and\n"
    .string "I still believe it.$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_RecurringEngineer_Act1::
    .string "[ENGINEER LEAD ROURKE:C1-A1] Hear that hum?\n"
    .string "I tuned these motors from scrap and they\n"
    .string "still outwork factory rigs.$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_RecurringEngineer_Act2::
    .string "[ENGINEER LEAD ROURKE:C1-A2] I rerouted power\n"
    .string "from the slot hall. Keep grunts off my\n"
    .string "junction boxes and we stay online.$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_RecurringEngineer_Act3::
    .string "[ENGINEER LEAD ROURKE:C1-A3] Not proud of\n"
    .string "what we built here. I will ship my team\n"
    .string "to evacuation support after this.$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_RecurringCaptain_Act1::
    .string "[FIELD CAPTAIN DRAKE:C1-A1] I have two squads\n"
    .string "holding the loading bay. One bad call and\n"
    .string "this whole basement becomes a trap.$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_RecurringCaptain_Act2::
    .string "[FIELD CAPTAIN DRAKE:C1-A2] Keep your order short\n"
    .string "and I execute. Soldiers don't debate while\n"
    .string "the line is live.$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_RecurringCaptain_Act3::
    .string "[FIELD CAPTAIN DRAKE:C1-A3] Celadon wraps soon.\n"
    .string "War discipline keeps people breathing;\n"
    .string "that's all I need to know.$"
